#. Cutscene 1, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/00_space_station.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene01.page0.0"
msgid "on a mysterious space station orbiting high above the earth ..."
msgstr ""
"a bord d'une mystérieuse station spatiale en orbite autour de la terre ..."

#. Cutscene 1, page 1 (over graphics/cutscenes/01_uka_uka_and_cortex.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene01.page1.0"
msgid ""
"uka uka:  cortex, remind me why i keep you around.  you have failed me one "
"too many times."
msgstr ""
"uka uka: cortex, rappelle-moi pourquoi je te garde! tu m'as trop souvent "
"déçu!"

#. Cutscene 1, page 2 (over graphics/cutscenes/02_cortex.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene01.page2.0"
msgid ""
"cortex:  uka uka!  forgive me ...  i've been wasting all these years trying "
"to vanquish that brainless bandicoot!  he is of no importance to us ...  we "
"want to take over the world!"
msgstr ""
"cortex: pardonne-moi uka uka! j'ai perdu tout ce temps à essayer de me "
"débarrasser de ce bandicoot sans cervelle! mais il n'est rien ... c'est le "
"monde que nous allons conquérir!"

#. Cutscene 1, page 3 (over graphics/cutscenes/01_uka_uka_and_cortex.png),
#. string 1 of 2.
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene01.page3.0"
msgid ""
"uka uka:  i've heard it all before, little scientist!  what is so different "
"this time?"
msgstr ""
"uka uka: j'ai déjà entendu ça, monsieur le scientifique du dimanche! "
"pourquoi réussirais-tu cette fois?!"

#. Cutscene 1, page 3 (over graphics/cutscenes/01_uka_uka_and_cortex.png),
#. string 2 of 2.
msgctxt "cutscene01.page3.1"
msgid ""
"cortex:  trust me uka, i have a little plan to bring earth's puny "
"inhabitants down to size ..."
msgstr ""
"cortex: fais-moi confiance uka, j'ai un plan pour remettre ces minables "
"terriens à leur place ... "

#. Cutscene 2, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/00_space_station.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page0.0"
msgid "cortex:  at last, my planetary minimizer is complete!"
msgstr "cortex: mon réducteur de planète est enfin terminé!"

#. Cutscene 2, page 1 (over graphics/cutscenes/03_cortex_hologram.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page1.0"
msgid "cortex: earthlings will bow to my superior intellect!"
msgstr ""
"cortex: les terriens devront s'incliner devant mon intelligence supérieure!"

#. Cutscene 2, page 2 (over graphics/cutscenes/04_minimizer_console.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page2.0"
msgid "cortex:  muahahahahaha!"
msgstr "cortex: ahahahahaha!"

#. Cutscene 2, page 5 (over graphics/cutscenes/07_cortex_on_monitors.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page5.0"
msgid ""
"cortex:  finally, after all these years of abuse, the tables have turned!  "
"who's the little guy now?  i, neo cortex, am your ruler.  you will look up "
"to me!  hahaha!"
msgstr ""
"cortex: après toutes ces années, la roue a enfin tourné! on fait moins le "
"malin maintenant, hein? moi, néo cortex, je suis le roi du monde. inclinez-"
"vous devant moi! ahaha!"

#. Cutscene 2, page 7 (over graphics/cutscenes/08_aku_aku_crash_and_coco.png),
#. string 1 of 2.
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page7.0"
msgid ""
"aku:  crash, coco, the world needs your help.  cortex has shrunk our planet "
"to the size of a grapefruit.  we must stop him."
msgstr ""
"aku: crash, coco, le monde a besoin de vous. cortex a réduit la planète à la "
"taille d'une orange. nous devons agir."

#. Cutscene 2, page 7 (over graphics/cutscenes/08_aku_aku_crash_and_coco.png),
#. string 2 of 2.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page7.1"
msgid ""
"coco:  it looks as if cortex is using the crystals to power his shrinking "
"machine ...  crash, if you can find the proper crystals from around the "
"world, i think i can build a device to reverse the effects."
msgstr ""
"coco: on dirait que cortex utilise les cristaux pour alimenter son "
"réducteur ... crash, si tu me ramènes les cristaux adéquats, je pense "
"pouvoir mettre au point un appareil capable d'inverser les effets de la "
"machine de cortex."

#. Cutscene 2, page 6 (over graphics/cutscenes/09_cortex_holding_earth.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page6.0"
msgid ""
"cortex:  i have finally won!  now nothing can stop me, not even that little "
"bandicoot!"
msgstr ""
"cortex: j'ai enfin gagné! rien ne peut plus m'arrêter, même pas ce petit "
"bandicoot!"

#. Cutscene 2, page 8 (over graphics/cutscenes/10_aku_aku.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene02.page8.0"
msgid ""
"aku:  good luck crash.  you must find the crystals so we can put an end to "
"cortex's evil scheme."
msgstr ""
"aku: bonne chance crash. il faut que tu trouves les cristaux pour mettre fin "
"aux plans diaboliques de cortex."

#. Cutscene 3, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/11_cortex_on_screen.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene03.page0.0"
msgid ""
"cortex:  i know what you are trying to do bandicoot - but it's not going to "
"work.  my minions will be ready for you!"
msgstr ""
"cortex: je sais ce que tu mijotes bandicoot, mais tu n'as aucune chance. mes "
"serviteurs t'attendent de pied ferme!"

#. Cutscene 4, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/11_cortex_on_screen.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene04.page0.0"
msgid ""
"cortex:  meddling marsupial!  you got lucky this time ...  my henchmen won't "
"be so easy on you in the future."
msgstr ""
"cortex: maudit marsupial! tu as eu de la chance cette fois ... mais mes "
"hommes de main ne se laisseront plus berner si facilement."

#. Cutscene 5, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/12_coco_on_screen.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene05.page0.0"
msgid ""
"coco:  great job crash!  i have half the crystals.  now bring me the rest of "
"them, so i can finish my machine - but be careful, cortex is watching you!"
msgstr ""
"coco: bien joué crash! j'ai récupéré la moitié des cristaux. apporte-moi le "
"reste pour que je finisse de construire ma machine. mais sois prudent, "
"cortex te surveille!"

#. Cutscene 6, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/01_uka_uka_and_cortex.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene06.page0.0"
msgid ""
"uka:  cortex, i knew this would happen!  crash has defeated three of your "
"stooges!  he must be stopped.  i will not tolerate another failure."
msgstr ""
"uka: cortex, j'en étais sûr! crash a vaincu trois de tes sous-fifres! il "
"faut l'arrêter. je ne tolérerai pas un autre échec."

#. Cutscene 6, page 1 (over graphics/cutscenes/02_cortex.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene06.page1.0"
msgid ""
"cortex:  uka ...  i'm sorry!  however, do not be overly concerned - my "
"planetary minimizer will stop him!"
msgstr ""
"cortex: uka ... je suis désolé! mais ne t'inquiète pas, mon réducteur de "
"planète va l'arrêter!"

#. Cutscene 7, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/12_coco_on_screen.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene07.page0.0"
msgid ""
"coco:  okay crash, i have all of the crystals, but i need you to destroy the "
"shrinking machine before i can return earth to its original state.  i'll use "
"the enlarger to make you big enough to take on cortex!"
msgstr ""
"coco: okay crash, j'ai tous les cristaux mais il faut que tu détruises le "
"réducteur de planète avant que je puisse ramener la terre à sa taille "
"normale. j'utiliserai l'agrandisseur pour que tu sois assez grand pour "
"affronter cortex!"

#. Cutscene 10, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/13_minimizer_overload.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene10.page0.0"
msgid "cortex:  you fool!  it will take me forever to fix this mess!"
msgstr "cortex: crétin! il va me falloir des années pour réparer tout ça!"

#. Cutscene 8, page 0 (over graphics/cutscenes/13_minimizer_overload.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene08.page0.0"
msgid ""
"cortex:  you idiot!  what have you done?  you have destroyed the stabilizer "
"crystals!  the unrestrained power of the minimizer is highly unpredictable!"
msgstr ""
"cortex: espèce d'imbécile! regarde ce que tu as fait?! tu as détruit les "
"cristaux stabilisateurs! si elle n'est pas maîtrisée, la puissance du "
"réducteur est imprévisible!"

#. Cutscene 8, page 1 (over graphics/cutscenes/14_bosses_shocked.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene08.page1.0"
msgid "arrgh!  ahhh!!!"
msgstr "arrgh!  ahhh!!!"

#. Cutscene 8, page 2 (over graphics/cutscenes/15_monster.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene08.page2.0"
msgid "monster:  what have you done to us?"
msgstr "monstre: qu'est-ce que tu nous as fait?!"

#. Cutscene 8, page 3 (over graphics/cutscenes/16_monster_and_crash.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene08.page3.0"
msgid "monster:  you will pay little bandicoot!"
msgstr "monstre: tu vas nous le payer petit bandicoot!"

#. Cutscene 9, page 1 (over graphics/cutscenes/18_coco_at_enlarger.png).
#. Also shown as cutscene 10's page 2.
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene09.page1.0"
msgid ""
"coco:  super!  you got all the crystals!  let's hope there's enough power in "
"these to reverse cortex's dirty work."
msgstr ""
"coco: super! tu as tous les cristaux! pourvu qu'ils soient assez puissants "
"pour faire rentrer les choses dans l'ordre ..."

#. Cutscene 9, page 5 (over graphics/cutscenes/22_reversed_beam.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene09.page5.0"
msgid "the end?!"
msgstr "fin?!"

#. Cutscene 10, page 5 (over graphics/cutscenes/10_aku_aku.png).
#. The cutscene text is drawn in the small font, word-wrapped into a 228x30 px
#. box (3 lines) under the picture; longer text goes on after a key press.
msgctxt "cutscene10.page5.0"
msgid ""
"aku:  crash, you've done well ...  but cortex is still a threat to us, as "
"his space station and planetary minimizer have not been destroyed.  you must "
"go back and retrieve the gems and relics from each location."
msgstr ""
"aku: bien joué crash ... mais cortex constitue toujours une menace car sa "
"station spatiale et son réducteur n'ont pas été détruits. tu dois repartir "
"chercher les gemmes."

